+ * Qutai patch: certificate errors the user chose to continue past (the certificateExceptions prop).
+ *
+ * The app's error page offers "Continue anyway" for a certificate the WebView refused; when the user taps it, the app
+ * adds "host:port sha256" to this WebView's list and loads the page again. onReceivedSslError proceeds only when the
+ * failing request's host and port and the SHA-256 of the presented certificate are in that list, so the WebView never
+ * proceeds on its own: every proceed is a decision the user made for that exact certificate (Google Play's rule for
