+/*
+ * WKContentRuleListStore is main-thread only (WK_SWIFT_UI_ACTOR); the methods below run on the TurboModule queue
+ * (this module has no methodQueue), so every store call is sent to the main queue. Touching the store first from
+ * that queue initialises WebKit off the main thread, which crashed at launch before the first WKWebView existed.
+ * The store calls its completion handlers once, on the main thread, so each promise settles exactly once.
+ */
